Package: brstocks
Title: Brazilian Stock Market Data and Analysis
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("João Paulo", "dos Santos Pereira Barbosa", 
           email = "joao.31582129@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to retrieve and analyze historical stock data 
    from the Brazilian stock exchange (B3) and other markets via Yahoo Finance.
    Includes functions for calculating returns, beta, correlation and 
    covariance matrices, supporting quantitative finance analysis.
